<%--
Test_Preload_Load_Keys - SSR preload, load()'s cache write and the cache read all use
ONE key derivation (component-cache.ts generate_cache_key).

Before the fix there were three: preload-data.ts and component.ts load() built keys
without content serialization, so an object-arg component preloaded nothing and wrote
nothing, and a cache_id() component's key shape never matched a preload entry.
--%>
<Define:Test_Preload_Load_Keys>
  <h2>Preload / load() / cache key agreement</h2>
  <div $sid="results"></div>
</Define:Test_Preload_Load_Keys>
